a applications.\n\n---\n\n#### 7. Live Mandi Commodity Rates & Welfare Schemes\n- **Mandi Search Filter:**\n  - Filtered by `\"Tomato\"` -> Accurately filtered to 1 row (`Hybrid Tomato`, Pimpalgaon Mandi, Nashik, ₹1,200 MSP, ₹2,100 Modal Price, +6.5% Trend).\n  - Filtered by `\"Mustard\"` -> Accurately filtered to 1 row (`Mustard Seed`, Bharatpur Mandi, Rajasthan, ₹5,650 MSP, ₹5,920 Modal Price, +1.9% Trend).\n  - Cleared search -> Instantly restored full 8-item commodity dataset.\n- **Welfare Schemes Modal:**\n  - Clicked \"View Application Steps\" on `PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)`.\n  - Verified step-by-step portal instructions (`pmkisan.gov.in`), required documents (Aadhaar Card, Khatauni/Jamabandi/RoR, Aadhaar-linked Bank Passbook, OTP Mobile Number), and official portal outbound link.\n  - Closed modal cleanly.\n\n---\n\n#### 8. AI Agronomist Chat Drawer & Simulated Voice Input\n- **Drawer Opening:** Triggered via floating action button `Ask Krishi AI`.\n- **Quick Prompt Chip:** Clicked `\"Best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil?\"`.\n  - Assistant delivered formatted, agronomic breakdown of basal vs top dressing doses, micronutrients, and drainage milestones.\n- **Simulated Voice Input:**\n  - Clicked microphone button (`Voice Input / Speech-to-Text`).\n  - Pulsing voice state activated (`Listening to your voice...`).\n  - Speech was transcribed into query *\"What is the best fertilizer for paddy in clay soil?\"* and automatically answered by the AI Agronomist.\n\n---\n\n#### 9. Visual Integrity, Console & Network Inspection\n- **Console Errors:** `0` runtime JavaScript errors or unhandled exceptions logged.\n- **Broken Images:** All 7 image assets (Unsplash crop profiles and pathological leaf samples) loaded with valid dimensions and 200 HTTP statuses.\n- **Layout & Responsiveness:** Clean styling with Tailwind typography, rounded cards, micro-animations, accessible color contrast, and proper modal overlays.\n\nAll features and user flows function correctly with excellent performance and design fidelity.\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
